	)
	(text "POWER: 2 x AAA (2.0-3.2 V) on J1 -> Q1 AO3401A reverse-battery guard (gate to GND: on when the cells\nare the right way round, body diode blocks when reversed) -> VBAT -> U1 TPS61023 boost, always on\n(EN tied to VIN). 3V3 = 0.595 V x (1 + R1/R2) = 0.595 x (1 + 1M/220k) = 3.30 V. L1 1 uH.\nVBAT_SENSE = VBAT / 2 (R3/R4 1M, ~1.5 uA) -> IO3 (ADC1_CH3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1e78805d-b2f9-54aa-9de9-13bbd3583a4b")
	)
	(text "MCU: ESP32-C3-WROOM-02 (PCB antenna on the board's back edge, copper-free underneath).\nIO0 PIR_OUT and IO1 BTN wake it from deep sleep (only IO0-IO5 can). IO4/IO5/IO6 = I2S BCLK/LRCLK/DIN,\nIO7 AMP_SD. Straps IO2/IO8/IO9 pulled high. Native USB (IO18/IO19) on J2 pogo pads."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c4e36a40-8362-550a-89f4-806684f4c860")
	)
	(text "PIR: AM312 on an RC-filtered supply (R10/C8): PIRs false-trigger on boost / class-D / Wi-Fi ripple.\nOUT is high ~2 s after motion."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "617d6c52-f35d-5055-8f54-e8a84141a781")
	)
	(text "SOUND: MAX98357A (mono, left channel when SD_MODE is driven high; R11 keeps it off otherwise).\nGAIN_SLOT open = 9 dB. R12/R13 100R in series with the piezo limit the class-D edge current into\nits capacitance (~100 kHz low-pass). For an 8 ohm speaker on BZ1's pads, fit 0R instead."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "16074d5e-8b55-5304-aca6-a1531c2dc9df")
	)
